+#### Web Push (optional)
+
+To deliver tray notifications to phones and desktops, provide a VAPID key pair:
+
+- `VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY`
+- `VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`
+
+Generate a pair with:
+
+```sh
+docker run --rm ghcr.io/basecamp/fizzy:main bin/rails runner 'key = WebPush.generate_key; puts "VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=#{key.public_key}"; puts "VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=#{key.private_key}"'
